  </div></header><main data-dc-tpl="476" style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0px auto; padding: clamp(56px, 6vw, 80px) clamp(16px, 3vw, 32px) 110px;">
  <div data-dc-tpl="477" style="max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 64px;">
    <div data-dc-tpl="478" style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: var(--action); margin-bottom: 16px;">HOW IT WORKS</div>
    <h1 data-dc-tpl="479" style="font-size: clamp(36px, 4.6vw, 52px); line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-weight: 800; margin: 0px 0px 18px; text-wrap: balance;">Nothing here is a black box.</h1>
    <p data-dc-tpl="480" style="font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--muted); margin: 0px; text-wrap: pretty;">A HIP score is a sum of named findings. Here is the whole path, from a URL to a badge — and where a human can step in.</p>
  </div>

  <div data-dc-tpl="481" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, 220px) minmax(0px, 1fr); gap: 0px; margin-bottom: 80px;">
    <div data-dc-tpl="482" style="border-right: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 0px 32px 0px 0px;">
      <div data-dc-tpl="483" style="position: sticky; top: 120px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--muted);">
        <div data-dc-tpl="484" style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 10px;">On this page</div>
        <div data-dc-tpl="485">1 — Collection</div>
        <div data-dc-tpl="486">2 — Detection</div>
        <div data-dc-tpl="487">3 — Scoring</div>
        <div data-dc-tpl="488">4 — Review &amp; appeal</div>
        <div data-dc-tpl="489">5 — Publication</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-dc-tpl="490" style="padding-left: clamp(0px, 3vw, 48px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 44px;">
      <div data-dc-tpl="491">
        <div data-dc-tpl="492" style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;"><span data-dc-tpl="493" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--action);">01</span><h2 data-dc-tpl="494" style="font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">Collection</h2></div>
        <p data-dc-tpl="495" style="font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--muted); margin: 0px; max-width: 640px; text-wrap: pretty;">HIP resolves the domain, follows redirects, negotiates TLS, reads DNS records and fetches the page as an ordinary visitor would. It records what it observed and when — not who asked. Provider lookups run in parallel and are attributed individually.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-dc-tpl="496">
        <div data-dc-tpl="497" style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;"><span data-dc-tpl="498" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--action);">02</span><h2 data-dc-tpl="499" style="font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">Detection</h2></div>
        <p data-dc-tpl="500" style="font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--muted); margin: 0px; max-width: 640px; text-wrap: pretty;">Each detection rule looks at the collected evidence and either fires or does not. A rule that fires produces a finding with an id, a severity, a plain-language reason, and — where one exists — a suggested fix.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-dc-tpl="501">
        <div data-dc-tpl="502" style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;"><span data-dc-tpl="503" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--action);">03</span><h2 data-dc-tpl="504" style="font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">Scoring</h2></div>
        <p data-dc-tpl="505" style="font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--muted); margin: 0px 0px 22px; max-width: 640px; text-wrap: pretty;">Findings carry weights. The score starts from a neutral baseline and moves as findings apply. The breakdown is always shown alongside the number, so the number never has to be taken on faith.</p>
        <div data-dc-tpl="506" style="background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 16px; padding: 26px; max-width: 640px;">
          <div data-dc-tpl="507" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 18px;"><span data-dc-tpl="508">EXAMPLE BREAKDOWN</span><span data-dc-tpl="509">SCORE 94</span></div>
          <div data-dc-tpl="510" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 13px; font-size: 14.5px;">
            <div data-dc-tpl="511" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;"><span data-dc-tpl="512" style="color: var(--text);">Baseline</span><span data-dc-tpl="513" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; color: var(--muted);">70</span></div>
            <div data-dc-tpl="514" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;"><span data-dc-tpl="515" style="color: var(--text);">HTTPS enforced, HSTS present</span><span data-dc-tpl="516" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; color: var(--ok);">+12</span></div>
            <div data-dc-tpl="517" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;"><span data-dc-tpl="518" style="color: var(--text);">Certificate valid, trusted issuer</span><span data-dc-tpl="519" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; color: var(--ok);">+8</span></div>
            <div data-dc-tpl="520" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;"><span data-dc-tpl="521" style="color: var(--text);">Ownership verified via DNS</span><span data-dc-tpl="522" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; color: var(--ok);">+6</span></div>
            <div data-dc-tpl="523" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;"><span data-dc-tpl="524" style="color: var(--text);">No provider listings</span><span data-dc-tpl="525" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; color: var(--ok);">+4</span></div>
            <div data-dc-tpl="526" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;"><span data-dc-tpl="527" style="color: var(--text);">Mail authentication incomplete</span><span data-dc-tpl="528" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; color: var(--warn);">−6</span></div>
            <div data-dc-tpl="529" style="height: 1px; background: var(--border); margin: 3px 0px;"></div>
            <div data-dc-tpl="530" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; font-weight: 700;"><span data-dc-tpl="531">Trust score</span><span data-dc-tpl="532" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; color: var(--action);">94 / 100</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div data-dc-tpl="533">
        <div data-dc-tpl="534" style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;"><span data-dc-tpl="535" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--action);">04</span><h2 data-dc-tpl="536" style="font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">Review &amp; appeal</h2></div>
        <p data-dc-tpl="537" style="font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--muted); margin: 0px; max-width: 640px; text-wrap: pretty;">Automated checks get things wrong. Any finding marked appealable can be contested with context; a reviewer looks at the evidence and either upholds it, adjusts it, or fixes the rule for everyone. Feedback and outcomes are logged.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-dc-tpl="538">
        <div data-dc-tpl="539" style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;"><span data-dc-tpl="540" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--action);">05</span><h2 data-dc-tpl="541" style="font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">Publication</h2></div>
        <p data-dc-tpl="542" style="font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--muted); margin: 0px; max-width: 640px; text-wrap: pretty;">Results surface in the web portal, through the browser extension, and — for verified domains — as a domain verification record and an earned trust badge. A HIP-aware DNS service is planned so results can travel with a lookup rather than a page load.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
